<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UNC cut to underperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UNC cut to underperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James Financial said it lowered its rating on UNC Inc to underperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 1/8 to 13-1/4 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
